This repository is a Derivative Work: a Core ML conversion of Liquid-Codec's decoder for the Apple Neural Engine.
- models/lc_dec_ane_int8.mlmodelc, models/lc_dec_ane.mlmodelc, models/lc_tail_f32.bin: Liquid AI's decoder weights, converted (int8 and fp16 Core ML programs; float32 tail).
- convert/lc_ane.py: modified re-implementation of Liquid AI's decoder modeling code (changes listed at the top of the file).
- examples/, convert/export_tail.py: new code.
